# Account server for the IEP Writer (docs/ACCOUNTS.md). Both values are
# public by design: the publishable key only reaches what the database's
# row-level security allows. Leave them empty and the sign-in button is
# not shown and the app makes no network requests at all.
# The offline download (vite build --mode offline) ignores them.
#
# Switched off on 2026-11-02 until the operator installs the new
# infra/publish.sh on the box (docs/ACCOUNTS.md step 6): the old copy there
# refuses a page that may connect anywhere. To switch on, move the two
# values below onto the empty lines.
#   https://pfeinhhbuxokbwdcqsnu.supabase.co
#   sb_publishable_qpkJmEIIbN3HnCvpHk9Ycw_PsLDZ4lK
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
